### **2. Enhanced Repository Decorators** (Create)

```
src/main/java/com/example/jetnews/data/posts/impl/
├── CachedPostsRepository.kt    // Wraps PostsRepository with caching
└── (existing) FakePostsRepository.kt

src/main/java/com/example/jetnews/data/interests/impl/
